# Unit04
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit04核心词汇

attention/əˈtenʃn/注意力；关心/Please pay attention to the teacher.
attitude/ˈætɪtuːd/态度；看法/She has a positive attitude toward life.
attract/əˈtrækt/吸引；引起/The beautiful scenery attracts many tourists.
attribute/əˈtrɪbjuːt/归因于；属性/He attributed his success to hard work.
audience/ˈɔːdiəns/观众；听众/The audience applauded warmly.
authority/ɔːˈθɔːrəti/权威；当局/The local authority made the decision.
automatic/ˌɔːtəˈmætɪk/自动的/The door has an automatic lock.
available/əˈveɪləbl/可用的；有空的/The book is available in the library.
average/ˈævərɪdʒ/平均的；一般的/The average temperature is 20 degrees.
avoid/əˈvɔɪd/避免；回避/You should avoid eating too much sugar.
await/əˈweɪt/等待；期待/We are awaiting your reply.
awake/əˈweɪk/醒着的；唤醒/I was awake all night.
award/əˈwɔːrd/奖励；授予/She won an award for her research.
aware/əˈwer/意识到的；知道的/He was aware of the danger ahead.
awful/ˈɔːfl/糟糕的；可怕的/The weather was awful yesterday.
background/ˈbækɡraʊnd/背景；经历/He has a strong background in science.
backward/ˈbækwərd/向后的；落后的/The region is economically backward.
bacteria/bækˈtɪriə/细菌/Bacteria can cause many diseases.
balance/ˈbæləns/平衡；余额/You need to balance work and life.
ball/bɔːl/球；舞会/The children were playing with a ball.
ban/bæn/禁止；禁令/The government imposed a ban on smoking in public.
band/bænd/乐队；带子/The band played at the concert last night.
bank/bæŋk/银行；河岸/I need to go to the bank to withdraw money.
bar/bɑːr/酒吧；条/There is a bar on the corner of the street.
bare/ber/裸露的；空的/He walked on the beach with bare feet.
bargain/ˈbɑːrɡən/便宜货；讨价还价/This jacket is a real bargain.
barrier/ˈbæriər/障碍；屏障/Language can be a barrier to communication.
base/beɪs/基础；基地/The company has its base in New York.
basic/ˈbeɪsɪk/基本的；基础的/Food and water are basic human needs.
basin/ˈbeɪsn/盆地；脸盆/The water in the basin is very clean.
basis/ˈbeɪsɪs/基础；根据/On what basis did you make the decision?
basket/ˈbæskɪt/篮子；篮/She put the fruit in a basket.
bathe/beɪð/洗澡；沐浴/She bathed the baby every evening.
battery/ˈbætəri/电池/The battery of my phone is almost dead.
battle/ˈbætl/战斗；斗争/The two armies fought a fierce battle.
bay/beɪ/海湾/The ship anchored in the bay.
beach/biːtʃ/海滩；沙滩/We spent the day at the beach.
beam/biːm/光束；横梁/A beam of light shone through the window.
bear/ber/忍受；承担/I can't bear the noise any longer.
beat/biːt/打败；敲打/Our team beat theirs by 3 points.
beauty/ˈbjuːti/美丽；美人/The beauty of the sunset is breathtaking.
because/bɪˈkɔːz/因为/He stayed home because he was sick.
become/bɪˈkʌm/成为；变成/She became a famous scientist.
bedroom/ˈbedruːm/卧室/My bedroom is on the second floor.
beef/biːf/牛肉/The beef is very tender.
beer/bɪr/啤酒/He ordered a glass of beer.
before/bɪˈfɔːr/在…之前/Please arrive before 9 o'clock.
beg/beɡ/请求；乞求/He begged for forgiveness.
begin/bɪˈɡɪn/开始/The meeting will begin at 10 a.m.
behalf/bɪˈhæf/代表；利益/I'm speaking on behalf of the whole team.
